      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey, i've been seeing so much about 'gentle parenting' on my feed lately and honestly it just seems like a recipe for disaster. it feels like kids today are just becoming totally undisciplined because nobody sets real boundaries anymore. do u agree that this shift in parenting is actually a step backwards for how we raise kids?",
